We’ll do it safely in this order:

Write the AKS Terraform configuration.
Run terraform plan.
Review exactly what Azure will create.
Only then run terraform apply, because the AKS worker VM costs money.
Deploy the image from ACR.
Delete the resources with terraform destroy when practice is finished.

